{
  "title": "Bilirubin\u2013albumin coupling does not establish improved cross-cycle prediction of adult FEV1",
  "abstract": "A standardized serum bilirubin\u00d7albumin interaction did not establish improved cross-cycle FEV1 prediction beyond nonlinear marginal biochemistry, anthropometry, demographics and smoking. Trained in NHANES2007\u20132008 (n=3727) and tested in separately sampled NHANES2009\u20132010 (n=4115), adding the product reduced MEC-weighted MSE by 58.67 mL\u00b2 (95% joint source-refit/target PSU-bootstrap interval -2749.59 to 2993.51), or 0.0291% of baseline error. This negative predictive test does not establish equivalence or refute bilirubin physiology. AI-authored; author checks and clean rerun completed, not independent peer review.",
